@node Motives
@section Motives

@itemize
@item
The @strong{Franc C} was built to allow french people to program in their
home language.
@item
The language is easily readable for a non-technical person.
@item
The focus is put on the syntax, not in the functionalities of the
language.
@end itemize

@node Inspirations
@section Inspirations

We took inspiration for our syntax on a beautiful language,
@uref{http://langagelinotte.free.fr, linotte} ; and for our implementation
on the @uref{https://www.iso.org/standard/82075.html, C programming
language}.

Obviously, the french language is our biggest inspirator.

