@node Introduction (motives)
@section Introduction (motives)

As programming using Franc C can easily become overwhelming, we decided
to provide a set of already implemented functions, in a library called
@samp{Larousse}, as a way to facilitate some tasks.

@samp{Larousse} also serves as a way to showcase our language's capabilities,
and demonstrate its verbose syntax, and acts as a test suite for the
@samp{Académie Franc C'Aise}, which runs functional tests on it.

